- id: TC_PURCH_001
  module: purchase
  title: Purchase Bill ka form khulna chahiye
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - smoke
  expected:
  - Purchase menu -> Bill ke + se form khule
  - Party Name field dikhe
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: purchase_bill
  - action: assert_text
    value: Party Name
  - action: close_form
- id: TC_PURCH_002
  module: purchase
  title: Purchase Bill me party aur item jodna
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - smoke
  destructive: true
  preconditions:
  - Kam se kam ek item aur ek supplier ledger ho
  expected:
  - Grid me ek line bane
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: purchase_bill
  - action: set_party
    value: Cash Account
  - action: add_item
    value: Sample Item | 5
  - action: expect_lines
    value: '1'
  - action: close_form
- id: TC_INV_001
  module: inventory
  title: Stock se zyada bechne pe app kuch to kahe
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - inventory
  - negative
  destructive: true
  preconditions:
  - Control Room me 'Stock Negative Allowed' ki setting is test ka natija badalti
    hai
  expected:
  - Ya warning aaye, ya line na jude -- chupchaap 999999 accept na ho
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: sale_bill
  - action: set_party
    value: Cash Account
  - action: add_item
    value: Sample Item | 999999
  - action: screenshot
    value: negative_stock
    note: Jo bhi hua uska saboot
  - action: close_form
- id: TC_INV_002
  module: inventory
  title: Item List me stock column dikhna chahiye
  priority: p2
  tags:
  - inventory
  expected:
  - Grid me Stock column ho
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: assert_text
    value: Stock
  - action: assert_text
    value: M.R.P
